  "version": "0.30.2",
  "released": "2026-10-15",
  "notes": [
    "The check-in list reaches down to the last letter beside it, instead of stopping partway with empty space below.",
    "Payroll files for any payroll service: your own layout can split first and last names and vacation and sick hours, and add a code on every row.",
    "Payroll summary on Hours and payroll prints everyone's hours, time off and pay items on one page, for typing into a payroll website.",
    "Macs can check for updates and update themselves: they couldn't reach the update file before (BUG-145).",
    "On a computer without Google Chrome, Setup → This computer says to install it, so Front Desk opens in its own window (BUG-146)."
  ],
  "how": "Shahien will send you the new installer. Install it over the old one; your records stay as they are.",
